            ['start_time' => 336.72, 'end_time' => 337.9, 'target_text' => 'Biggest of the umam.', 'source_text' => 'Umat yang paling besar.', 'order' => 101],
            ['start_time' => 338.0, 'end_time' => 347.659, 'target_text' => 'We are the largest in number from all the um from all the nations the um that passed previously whether it\'s Moses may peace', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah bilangan yang teramai daripada semua umat-umat terdahulu yang telah berlalu, sama ada umat Nabi Musa \'alaihissalam,', 'order' => 102],
            ['start_time' => 347.759, 'end_time' => 355.5, 'target_text' => 'Be upon him Jesus may (peace be upon him) uh or all the others Noah may (peace be upon him) all these prophets of Allah Ibraim', 'source_text' => 'Nabi Isa \'alaihissalam, atau nabi-nabi yang lain, Nabi Nuh \'alaihissalam, kesemua para nabi Allah, Nabi Ibrahim', 'order' => 103],
            ['start_time' => 355.6, 'end_time' => 364.3, 'target_text' => 'May (peace be upon him) the Prophet ((sallallahu alaihi wasallam)) his Ummah is the largest in number largest and he gets a reward', 'source_text' => '\'Alaihissalam, sesungguhnya umat Nabi Muhammad (sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam) adalah yang paling ramai bilangannya dan baginda mendapat pahala', 'order' => 104],
            ['start_time' => 364.4, 'end_time' => 371.9, 'target_text' => 'For every good deed we ever do right up to the end because he taught us all the goodness that we have all of it.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi setiap amalan kebaikan yang kita lakukan sehingga ke akhir zaman kerana bagindalah yang mengajarkan kepada kita segala kebaikan yang kita nikmati, keseluruhannya.', 'order' => 105],
            ['start_time' => 372.0, 'end_time' => 379.58, 'target_text' => 'There was a a brother and a sister who was arguing that I don\'t believe in hadith I just believe in Quran and that\'s it.', 'source_text' => 'Pernah ada seorang saudara dan saudari yang berhujah bahawa saya tidak percaya kepada hadis, saya hanya percaya kepada Al-Quran semata-mata.', 'order' => 106],
            ['start_time' => 379.68, 'end_time' => 381.26, 'target_text' => 'So I said look let\'s talk about it.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu saya berkata, mari kita berbincang mengenainya.', 'order' => 107],
            ['start_time' => 381.36, 'end_time' => 390.999, 'target_text' => 'So anyway we met when we met at a certain place as we entered they greeted how did they greet what did they sayalamlaykum', 'source_text' => 'Maka kami pun bertemu di suatu tempat, dan sebaik sahaja kami melangkah masuk, mereka memberi salam, apakah ucapan salam mereka? Assalamu\'alaikum.', 'order' => 108],
            ['start_time' => 392.4, 'end_time' => 395.16, 'target_text' => 'I said that\'s already in hadithalamlaykum', 'source_text' => 'Saya terus berkata: Itu sudah sedia ada di dalam hadis, memberi ucapan Assalamu\'alaikum.', 'order' => 109],
            ['start_time' => 395.759, 'end_time' => 397.559, 'target_text' => 'That', 'source_text' => 'Itu', 'order' => 110],
            ['start_time' => 397.919, 'end_time' => 404.379, 'target_text' => 'Is from hadith where did you get it from I got it from the hadith it means you actually practicing upon it first thing soon', 'source_text' => 'Berasal daripada hadis! Dari manakah kalian mempelajarinya? Saya mengambilnya dari hadis, bermakna kalian sebenarnya mengamalkannya sejak mula melangkah masuk.', 'order' => 111],
            ['start_time' => 404.479, 'end_time' => 408.119, 'target_text' => 'As I entered they said no Allah says', 'source_text' => 'Apabila saya masuk, mereka berkata: Tidak, Allah berfirman...', 'order' => 112],
            ['start_time' => 409.68, 'end_time' => 412.76, 'target_text' => 'So I said well Allah also says', 'source_text' => 'Maka saya berkata, Allah juga berfirman...', 'order' => 113],
            ['start_time' => 414.16, 'end_time' => 416.279, 'target_text' => 'That\'s not', 'source_text' => 'Bukan begitu', 'order' => 114],
            ['start_time' => 416.72, 'end_time' => 419.9, 'target_text' => 'When you meet someone you says.', 'source_text' => 'Bila kamu bertemu seseorang kamu mengucapkan salam.', 'order' => 115],
            ['start_time' => 420.0, 'end_time' => 420.939, 'target_text' => 'Where did you get that from?', 'source_text' => 'Dari manakah kalian mendapat panduan itu?', 'order' => 116],
            ['start_time' => 421.039, 'end_time' => 422.379, 'target_text' => 'You got it from the hadith.', 'source_text' => 'Kalian mendapatkannya daripada sunnah dan hadis.', 'order' => 117],
            ['start_time' => 422.479, 'end_time' => 423.34, 'target_text' => 'That\'s just the beginning.', 'source_text' => 'Itu baru permulaannya.', 'order' => 118],
            ['start_time' => 423.44, 'end_time' => 428.219, 'target_text' => 'And I always go, my brothers and sisters, we are cruising in an age of deception.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya selalu tegaskan, wahai saudara dan saudariku, kita sedang mengharungi zaman penuh tipu daya dan kepalsuan.', 'order' => 119],
            ['start_time' => 428.319, 'end_time' => 431.02, 'target_text' => 'Right now, we\'re cruising in an age of deception.', 'source_text' => 'Pada saat ini, kita sedang melayari era penuh penipuan.', 'order' => 120],
            ['start_time' => 431.12, 'end_time' => 439.58, 'target_text' => 'I\'m on social media for a long time and I can tell you a lot of the comments down in the comments section that are negative', 'source_text' => 'Saya sudah lama berkecimpung di media sosial dan saya boleh beritahu kalian banyak komen-komen negatif di ruangan komen', 'order' => 121],
            ['start_time' => 439.68, 'end_time' => 441.34, 'target_text' => 'Are actually not human beings.', 'source_text' => 'Sebenarnya bukan ditulis oleh manusia sebenar.', 'order' => 122],
            ['start_time' => 441.44, 'end_time' => 442.219, 'target_text' => 'They are bots.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah akaun bot.', 'order' => 123],
            ['start_time' => 442.319, 'end_time' => 443.659, 'target_text' => 'And the bots will talk to you.', 'source_text' => 'Dan bot-bot ini akan berinteraksi dengan kamu.', 'order' => 124],
            ['start_time' => 443.759, 'end_time' => 445.26, 'target_text' => 'They will interact with you.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka akan membalas mesej kamu.', 'order' => 125],
            ['start_time' => 445.36, 'end_time' => 447.18, 'target_text' => 'They will actually give you a proper answer.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka bahkan akan memberi jawapan yang seolah-olah meyakinkan.', 'order' => 126],
            ['start_time' => 447.28, 'end_time' => 449.98, 'target_text' => 'When you say something, they\'ll say something in the comment section.', 'source_text' => 'Bila kamu menyatakan sesuatu, mereka akan membalas sesuatu di ruangan komen.', 'order' => 127],
            ['start_time' => 450.08, 'end_time' => 452.78, 'target_text' => 'But when you click on it, how do you recognize a bot?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi apabila kamu menelitinya, bagaimana kamu mengenali sesebuah bot?', 'order' => 128],
            ['start_time' => 452.88, 'end_time' => 455.02, 'target_text' => 'There are so many ways of recognizing bots.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat begitu banyak cara untuk mengenali bot-bot ini.', 'order' => 129],
            ['start_time' => 455.12, 'end_time' => 456.78, 'target_text' => 'Many of us get angry and upset.', 'source_text' => 'Ramai antara kita menjadi marah dan kecewa.', 'order' => 130],
            ['start_time' => 456.88, 'end_time' => 466.379, 'target_text' => 'But the bots are AI being used on another level where the interactions are made by AI in order to do what?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi bot-bot ini adalah penggunaan AI pada tahap berbeza di mana interaksi dijana oleh AI untuk tujuan apa?', 'order' => 131],
            ['start_time' => 466.479, 'end_time' => 468.7, 'target_text' => 'In order to', 'source_text' => 'Bagi tujuan...', 'order' => 132],
            ['start_time' => 468.8, 'end_time' => 472.7, 'target_text' => 'In order to actually sway public opinion in a certain direction.', 'source_text' => 'Untuk memanipulasi dan memesongkan pandangan umum ke arah naratif tertentu.', 'order' => 133],
            ['start_time' => 472.8, 'end_time' => 473.819, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah hakikat sebenarnya.', 'order' => 134],
            ['start_time' => 473.919, 'end_time' => 474.939, 'target_text' => 'We are Muslims.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah orang Islam.', 'order' => 135],
            ['start_time' => 475.039, 'end_time' => 476.62, 'target_text' => 'We are loving people, kind people.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah insan yang penuh kasih sayang dan berhati mulia.', 'order' => 136],
            ['start_time' => 476.72, 'end_time' => 477.98, 'target_text' => 'What did Islam bring to you?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah yang dibawa oleh Islam kepada diri kamu?', 'order' => 137],
            ['start_time' => 478.08, 'end_time' => 483.58, 'target_text' => 'It brought to you high levels of morals and values and goodness and kindness.', 'source_text' => 'Ia membawa nilai moral dan akhlak yang tinggi, nilai murni, kebaikan, dan ihsan.', 'order' => 138],
            ['start_time' => 483.68, 'end_time' => 487.499, 'target_text' => 'And it brought to you the discipline that you have.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ia membawa disiplin yang jitu dalam kehidupan kamu.', 'order' => 139],
            ['start_time' => 487.599, 'end_time' => 488.939, 'target_text' => 'You pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu menunaikan solat lima waktu sehari semalam.', 'order' => 140],
            ['start_time' => 489.039, 'end_time' => 490.779, 'target_text' => 'You care for even the animals.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu menyayangi bahkan terhadap haiwan sekalipun.', 'order' => 141],
            ['start_time' => 490.879, 'end_time' => 493.099, 'target_text' => 'And you are an asset to society and community.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kamu adalah aset yang amat bernilai kepada masyarakat dan komuniti.', 'order' => 142],
            ['start_time' => 493.199, 'end_time' => 495.18, 'target_text' => 'You are the best husband, the best wife.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu menjadi suami yang terbaik, isteri yang terbaik.', 'order' => 143],
            ['start_time' => 495.28, 'end_time' => 497.74, 'target_text' => 'You are the best child and the best brother and sister.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu menjadi anak yang terbaik dan adik-beradik yang terbaik.', 'order' => 144],
            ['start_time' => 497.84, 'end_time' => 498.939, 'target_text' => 'You are supposed to be.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah yang sepatutnya bagi diri kamu.', 'order' => 145],
            ['start_time' => 499.039, 'end_time' => 500.219, 'target_text' => 'You\'re working towards it.', 'source_text' => 'Kamu sedang berusaha ke arah itu.', 'order' => 146],
            ['start_time' => 500.319, 'end_time' => 501.58, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what Islam did for me.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah impak yang diberikan oleh Islam kepada saya.', 'order' => 147],
            ['start_time' => 501.68, 'end_time' => 503.58, 'target_text' => 'And I worship Allah five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya beribadah kepada Allah lima kali sehari semalam.', 'order' => 148],
            ['start_time' => 503.68, 'end_time' => 506.939, 'target_text' => 'Even the non-Muslims know we pray five times a day.', 'source_text' => 'Malah orang bukan Islam pun tahu kita menunaikan solat lima waktu sehari.', 'order' => 149],
            ['start_time' => 507.039, 'end_time' => 508.7, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what Islam brought.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah ajaran murni yang dibawa oleh Islam.', 'order' => 150],
            ['start_time' => 508.8, 'end_time' => 511.26, 'target_text' => 'In order to sway public opinion against us.', 'source_text' => 'Namun demi memesongkan pandangan umum untuk membenci kita,', 'order' => 151],
            ['start_time' => 511.36, 'end_time' => 513.64, 'target_text' => 'It continuously', 'source_text' => 'Mereka secara berterusan', 'order' => 152],
            ['start_time' => 514.8, 'end_time' => 518.859, 'target_text' => 'Repeats bad statements about us.', 'source_text' => 'Mengulang-ulang tohmahan buruk mengenai diri kita.', 'order' => 153],
            ['start_time' => 518.959, 'end_time' => 526.46, 'target_text' => 'So those sometimes who are weak from amongst us and those who are not from amongst us, they begin to believe, you know what,', 'source_text' => 'Maka sebahagian yang lemah imannya dalam kalangan kita dan orang luar, mereka mula mempercayai tohmahan tersebut,', 'order' => 154],
            ['start_time' => 526.56, 'end_time' => 530.78, 'target_text' => 'These guys are not good people until they have firstirhand interactions.', 'source_text' => 'Bahawa orang-orang ini kononnya tidak baik, sehinggalah mereka berinteraksi secara bersemuka sendiri.', 'order' => 155],
            ['start_time' => 530.88, 'end_time' => 538.78, 'target_text' => 'And when they have firsthand interactions, you and I would hope that the person they interacted with teaches or portrays the', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila mereka berinteraksi secara langsung, kalian dan saya pasti berharap agar orang Islam yang mereka temui itu mempamerkan ajaran', 'order' => 156],
            ['start_time' => 538.88, 'end_time' => 543.419, 'target_text' => 'Proper Islam because many of us we don\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Islam yang sebenar, kerana sayangnya ramai antara kita yang tidak mencerminkannya.', 'order' => 157],
            ['start_time' => 543.519, 'end_time' => 550.52, 'target_text' => 'So we are here tonight to say let\'s not let the messenger (peace be upon him) down', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu kita berada di sini malam ini untuk menegaskan jangan sesekali kita mengecewakan Rasulullah (sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam)', 'order' => 158],
            ['start_time' => 551.36, 'end_time' => 554.299, 'target_text' => 'Because on the day of judgment he will be waiting for us.', 'source_text' => 'Kerana pada Hari Kiamat kelak, baginda akan menanti kedatangan kita.', 'order' => 159],
            ['start_time' => 554.399, 'end_time' => 561.739, 'target_text' => 'He will be waiting upon the pond known as alkar and we will be passing by and he will recognize us by the shining of the places', 'source_text' => 'Baginda akan menunggu di telaga yang dikenali sebagai Al-Kautsar dan kita akan melaluinya, dan baginda akan mengenali kita melalui cahaya pada anggota wuduk,', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 561.839, 'end_time' => 568.859, 'target_text' => 'We used to wash so many times a day when we were cleaning ourselves in preparation for prayer known as wudoo and when these', 'source_text' => 'Anggota yang kerap kita basuh berkali-kali sehari semasa menyucikan diri sebagai persiapan menunaikan solat yang dinamakan wuduk, dan apabila', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 568.959, 'end_time' => 576.12, 'target_text' => 'Places shine he will say oh Allah this person is from me and my um that\'s how he will recognize us', 'source_text' => 'Anggota-anggota ini bersinar-sinar, baginda akan bersabda: Wahai Allah, orang ini sebahagian daripadaku dan daripada umatku, begitulah cara baginda mengenali kita', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 576.48, 'end_time' => 585.1, 'target_text' => 'According to the hadith and so make your woodoo correctly pray push yourselves to pray yesterday I spoke in a place called', 'source_text' => 'Menurut hadis. Oleh itu sempurnakan wuduk kalian dengan betul, dirikan solat, doronglah diri kalian untuk bersolat! Semalam saya berceramah di sebuah tempat bernama', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 585.2, 'end_time' => 587.0, 'target_text' => 'Lanaka.', 'source_text' => 'Lanark.', 'order' => 164],
            ['start_time' => 587.68, 'end_time' => 590.62, 'target_text' => 'Some of the guys are laughing because we were corrected in the pronunciation.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian jemaah ketawa kerana sebutan kami dibetulkan.', 'order' => 165],
            ['start_time' => 590.72, 'end_time' => 594.7, 'target_text' => 'We were saying Lanaka because the R is where just before the K.', 'source_text' => 'Kami menyebut Lanaka kerana huruf R terletak sebelum K.', 'order' => 166],
            ['start_time' => 594.8, 'end_time' => 596.38, 'target_text' => 'But they told us no, it\'s Lan.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi mereka beritahu kami: Bukan, sebutannya Lanark.', 'order' => 167],
            ['start_time' => 596.48, 'end_time' => 598.94, 'target_text' => 'I said, okay, you have it your way.', 'source_text' => 'Saya kata, baiklah, ikut cara sebutan kamu.', 'order' => 168],
            ['start_time' => 599.04, 'end_time' => 602.46, 'target_text' => 'When you learn Tajid, you learn it according to the people of that language.', 'source_text' => 'Bila kamu belajar ilmu tajwid, kamu mempelajarinya mengikut lahjah penutur bahasa tersebut.', 'order' => 169],
            ['start_time' => 602.56, 'end_time' => 603.26, 'target_text' => 'Right?', 'source_text' => 'Betul bukan?', 'order' => 170],
            ['start_time' => 603.36, 'end_time' => 604.859, 'target_text' => 'But there, what did I say?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi di sana, apakah yang saya sampaikan?', 'order' => 171],
            ['start_time' => 604.959, 'end_time' => 606.14, 'target_text' => 'Subhan Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'order' => 172],
            ['start_time' => 606.24, 'end_time' => 612.94, 'target_text' => 'It\'s amazing because the Prophet ((sallallahu alaihi wasallam)) will recognize us', 'source_text' => 'Ia sungguh menakjubkan kerana Nabi (sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam) akan mengenali kita', 'order' => 173],
            ['start_time' => 613.04, 'end_time' => 615.1, 'target_text' => 'Based on', 'source_text' => 'Berdasarkan', 'order' => 174],
            ['start_time' => 615.2, 'end_time' => 618.22, 'target_text' => 'Our faces and our body parts shining.', 'source_text' => 'Cahaya yang memancar dari wajah dan anggota tubuh kita.', 'order' => 175],
            ['start_time' => 618.32, 'end_time' => 628.14, 'target_text' => 'I said if I were to give you one piece of advice, one only one and walk away, I would tell you make a bigger effort in establishing', 'source_text' => 'Saya katakan jika saya hanya diberi peluang memberi satu nasihat sahaja, satu sahaja lalu saya melangkah pergi, saya akan berpesan: Gandakan usaha kalian dalam mendirikan', 'order' => 176],
            ['start_time' => 628.24, 'end_time' => 629.58, 'target_text' => 'Your five daily prayers.', 'source_text' => 'Solat fardu lima waktu.', 'order' => 177],
            ['start_time' => 629.68, 'end_time' => 630.859, 'target_text' => 'That would be my piece of advice.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah pesanan tunggal saya.', 'order' => 178],
            ['start_time' => 630.959, 'end_time' => 633.9, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what I said yesterday and I repeat it again today.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah yang saya tegaskan semalam dan saya ulanginya sekali lagi pada hari ini.', 'order' => 179],
            ['start_time' => 634.0, 'end_time' => 636.62, 'target_text' => 'Although I want to go on to something else.', 'source_text' => 'Walaupun saya ingin menyentuh perkara yang lain.', 'order' => 180],
            ['start_time' => 636.72, 'end_time' => 639.9, 'target_text' => 'Make sure that you make an effort to do your five daily prayers.', 'source_text' => 'Pastikan kalian berusaha sedaya upaya menunaikan solat lima waktu.', 'order' => 181],
            ['start_time' => 640.0, 'end_time' => 640.94, 'target_text' => 'I know it\'s hard.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tahu ia sukar.', 'order' => 182],
            ['start_time' => 641.04, 'end_time' => 642.06, 'target_text' => 'I know it\'s tough.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tahu ia berat.', 'order' => 183],
            ['start_time' => 642.16, 'end_time' => 647.179, 'target_text' => 'I know we are in Dundee and this Dundee is a different Dundee from the Dundee in South Africa.', 'source_text' => 'Saya faham kita berada di Dundee dan Dundee ini berbeza daripada Dundee di Afrika Selatan.', 'order' => 184],
            ['start_time' => 647.279, 'end_time' => 649.02, 'target_text' => 'Do you know we have a Dundee in South Africa?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah kalian kita juga mempunyai kawasan bernama Dundee di Afrika Selatan?', 'order' => 185],
            ['start_time' => 649.12, 'end_time' => 650.78, 'target_text' => 'Did you ever know that?', 'source_text' => 'Pernahkah kalian mengetahui hal itu?', 'order' => 186],
            ['start_time' => 650.88, 'end_time' => 651.66, 'target_text' => 'Yes.', 'source_text' => 'Ya.', 'order' => 187],
            ['start_time' => 651.76, 'end_time' => 654.299, 'target_text' => 'And each place has its positives and negatives.', 'source_text' => 'Dan setiap tempat ada kelebihan serta kekurangannya.', 'order' => 188],
            ['start_time' => 654.399, 'end_time' => 656.54, 'target_text' => 'Would you like to live in this one or that one?', 'source_text' => 'Kalian lebih suka tinggal di sini atau di sana?', 'order' => 189],
            ['start_time' => 656.64, 'end_time' => 657.26, 'target_text' => 'This one.', 'source_text' => 'Di sini.', 'order' => 190],
            ['start_time' => 657.36, 'end_time' => 657.82, 'target_text' => 'This one.', 'source_text' => 'Di sini.', 'order' => 191],
            ['start_time' => 657.92, 'end_time' => 658.319, 'target_text' => 'This one.', 'source_text' => 'Di sini.', 'order' => 192],
            ['start_time' => 658.32, 'end_time' => 659.739, 'target_text' => 'Anyone would like to live in that one?', 'source_text' => 'Ada sesiapa yang ingin tinggal di sana?', 'order' => 193],
            ['start_time' => 659.839, 'end_time' => 661.5, 'target_text' => 'Put your hands up.', 'source_text' => 'Angkat tangan kalian.', 'order' => 194],
            ['start_time' => 661.6, 'end_time' => 662.06, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha-Allah.', 'order' => 195],
            ['start_time' => 662.16, 'end_time' => 662.78, 'target_text' => 'There are a few hands.', 'source_text' => 'Ada beberapa orang yang mengangkat tangan.', 'order' => 196],
            ['start_time' => 662.88, 'end_time' => 663.278, 'target_text' => 'Ya Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Ya Allah.', 'order' => 197],
            ['start_time' => 663.279, 'end_time' => 670.14, 'target_text' => 'We go together inshallah by the will of Allah subhanahu wa ta\'ala there are positives and negatives everywhere so the positives', 'source_text' => 'Kita pergi bersama-sama insya-Allah dengan izin Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala. Ada kebaikan dan cabaran di setiap tempat, kelebihannya', 'order' => 198],
            ['start_time' => 670.24, 'end_time' => 677.5, 'target_text' => 'Here mashallah you\'ve got relative peace you have relative stability you\'ve got decent people and so and so many more positives', 'source_text' => 'Di sini masha-Allah kalian menikmati keamanan relatif, kestabilan relatif, orang-orang yang baik dan banyak lagi kelebihan lain,', 'order' => 199],
            ['start_time' => 677.6, 'end_time' => 684.859, 'target_text' => 'But there is one negative here that I can pick on and I\'ve picked on it everywhere I\'ve been to a place called Kanor did I', 'source_text' => 'Namun ada satu perkara yang mencabar di sini yang ingin saya sebutkan, dan saya perhatikan di merata tempat. Saya pernah ke tempat bernama Cumnock, adakah saya', 'order' => 200],
            ['start_time' => 684.959, 'end_time' => 692.22, 'target_text' => 'Pronounce it correctly I went to a place called Lania this evening we went to a place called Perth mashallah not the Perth', 'source_text' => 'Menyebutnya dengan betul? Saya ke sebuah tempat bernama Lanark, petang tadi kami ke sebuah tempat bernama Perth, masha-Allah, bukanlah Perth', 'order' => 201],
            ['start_time' => 692.32, 'end_time' => 696.859, 'target_text' => 'Of Australia But the Perth of the UK and now we\'re in the Dundee of the UK.', 'source_text' => 'Di Australia, tetapi Perth di UK dan kini kita berada di Dundee, UK.', 'order' => 202],
            ['start_time' => 696.959, 'end_time' => 701.5, 'target_text' => 'I want to tell you one positive we have in South Africa is', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin beritahu kalian satu kelebihan yang kami miliki di Afrika Selatan ialah', 'order' => 203],
            ['start_time' => 701.6, 'end_time' => 704.52, 'target_text' => 'The timings of the prayers.', 'source_text' => 'Waktu-waktu solatnya.', 'order' => 204],
            ['start_time' => 705.6, 'end_time' => 706.38, 'target_text' => 'You see that alarm.', 'source_text' => 'Kalian nampak penggera itu.', 'order' => 205],
            ['start_time' => 706.48, 'end_time' => 707.739, 'target_text' => 'Can you hear it?', 'source_text' => 'Bolehkah kalian mendengarnya?', 'order' => 206],
            ['start_time' => 707.839, 'end_time' => 711.079, 'target_text' => 'That usually happens in South Africa.', 'source_text' => 'Perkara sebegitu biasanya berlaku di Afrika Selatan.', 'order' => 207],
            ['start_time' => 711.68, 'end_time' => 712.859, 'target_text' => 'But look, Allah is showing me.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi lihatlah, Allah sedang menunjukkan kepada saya.', 'order' => 208],
            ['start_time' => 712.959, 'end_time' => 717.979, 'target_text' => 'I was about to talk about the safety and Allah says, "Hang on, we\'ll do it in this dundy too.', 'source_text' => 'Baru sahaja saya hendak bercakap mengenai faktor keselamatan, Allah menunjukkan: Tunggu sebentar, penggera berbunyi di Dundee ini juga.', 'order' => 209],
            ['start_time' => 718.079, 'end_time' => 723.319, 'target_text' => 'May Allah protect us." That I don\'t think is anything serious.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah melindungi kita. Saya fikir itu tiada apa-apa yang serius.', 'order' => 210],
            ['start_time' => 724.0, 'end_time' => 726.62, 'target_text' => 'May Allah protect you always.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah sentiasa melindungi kalian.', 'order' => 211],
            ['start_time' => 726.72, 'end_time' => 730.14, 'target_text' => 'I just saw a brother pressing a button and the sound stopped.', 'source_text' => 'Saya baru sahaja melihat seorang jemaah menekan butang dan bunyinya berhenti.', 'order' => 212],
            ['start_time' => 730.24, 'end_time' => 732.28, 'target_text' => 'Allah bless.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah memberkati.', 'order' => 213],
            ['start_time' => 732.639, 'end_time' => 735.58, 'target_text' => 'I think that was our vehicle to be honest.', 'source_text' => 'Sejujurnya saya rasa itu penggera kenderaan kami.', 'order' => 214],
            ['start_time' => 735.68, 'end_time' => 740.6, 'target_text' => 'But nonetheless, one of the favors of Allah upon us', 'source_text' => 'Namun demikian, salah satu nikmat Allah ke atas kami', 'order' => 215],
            ['start_time' => 741.68, 'end_time' => 748.46, 'target_text' => 'Back in the southern hemisphere is that the timings of the prayers are not that challenging in different seasons of the year.', 'source_text' => 'Di hemisfera selatan ialah waktu solatnya tidak terlalu ekstrem merentasi musim-musim yang berbeza sepanjang tahun.', 'order' => 216],
            ['start_time' => 748.56, 'end_time' => 756.22, 'target_text' => 'But here do you not agree that sometimes the fast is so long and sometimes Allah always is just so he makes it very short', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi di sini tidakkah kalian bersetuju bahawa kadangkala tempoh berpuasa sangat panjang, dan kadangkala Allah Yang Maha Adil menjadikannya sangat pendek', 'order' => 217],
            ['start_time' => 756.32, 'end_time' => 756.72, 'target_text' => 'For you.', 'source_text' => 'Bagi kalian.', 'order' => 218],
            ['start_time' => 756.8, 'end_time' => 762.94, 'target_text' => 'So in the winter months the fast is a walk in the park and in the summer months Allahbar', 'source_text' => 'Maka pada bulan-bulan musim sejuk puasa terasa begitu mudah seperti bersiar-siar di taman, manakala pada musim panas, Allahu Akbar,', 'order' => 219],
            ['start_time' => 763.04, 'end_time' => 770.539, 'target_text' => 'You have to fast and fast and fast and that\'s the only time the fast becomes a slow right because it just doesn\'t end.', 'source_text' => 'Kalian perlu berpuasa dan terus berpuasa dan berpuasa, dan itulah waktu di mana \'fast\' (puasa) menjadi perlahan kerana siangnya seakan tidak berakhir.', 'order' => 220],
            ['start_time' => 770.639, 'end_time' => 774.22, 'target_text' => 'But subhan Allah how many hours is the longest fast here?', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi subhanallah, berapa jamkah tempoh puasa paling panjang di sini?', 'order' => 221],
            ['start_time' => 774.32, 'end_time' => 776.92, 'target_text' => '21 21', 'source_text' => '21 jam! 21 jam!', 'order' => 222],
            ['start_time' => 777.279, 'end_time' => 781.48, 'target_text' => 'Allahbar may Allah save me from', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar, semoga Allah selamatkan daku daripada...', 'order' => 223],
            ['start_time' => 782.72, 'end_time' => 783.58, 'target_text' => 'Oh, he said dundi.', 'source_text' => 'Oh, dia yang sebut Dundee!', 'order' => 224],
            ['start_time' => 783.68, 'end_time' => 784.14, 'target_text' => 'I didn\'t say it.', 'source_text' => 'Bukan saya yang mengatakannya.', 'order' => 225],
            ['start_time' => 784.24, 'end_time' => 784.78, 'target_text' => 'You said it.', 'source_text' => 'Kalian yang menyebutnya.', 'order' => 226],
            ['start_time' => 784.88, 'end_time' => 785.739, 'target_text' => 'Allahbar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 227],
            ['start_time' => 785.839, 'end_time' => 786.239, 'target_text' => 'No, no.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak, tidak.', 'order' => 228],
            ['start_time' => 786.24, 'end_time' => 786.64, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha-Allah.', 'order' => 229],
            ['start_time' => 786.72, 'end_time' => 787.12, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha-Allah.', 'order' => 230],
            ['start_time' => 787.2, 'end_time' => 787.979, 'target_text' => 'Allah abar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 231],
            ['start_time' => 788.079, 'end_time' => 789.979, 'target_text' => 'But it\'s it\'s something challenging.', 'source_text' => 'Namun ia adalah satu cabaran yang hebat.', 'order' => 232],
            ['start_time' => 790.079, 'end_time' => 791.02, 'target_text' => 'You get a good reward.', 'source_text' => 'Kalian mendapat ganjaran pahala yang sangat besar.', 'order' => 233],
            ['start_time' => 791.12, 'end_time' => 797.02, 'target_text' => 'I was saying if you are wealthy enough in the summer months, if Ramadan is in the summer months and you\'re wealthy enough', 'source_text' => 'Saya pernah katakan jika kalian cukup berkemampuan pada bulan-bulan musim panas, sekiranya Ramadan jatuh pada musim panas dan kalian mampu', 'order' => 234],
            ['start_time' => 797.12, 'end_time' => 802.199, 'target_text' => 'To go to a country where the fasting is shorter, are you allowed to go?', 'source_text' => 'Untuk pergi ke negara yang tempoh puasanya lebih pendek, adakah kalian dibenarkan pergi?', 'order' => 235],
            ['start_time' => 802.639, 'end_time' => 803.739, 'target_text' => 'Yes, you are.', 'source_text' => 'Ya, kalian dibenarkan.', 'order' => 236],
            ['start_time' => 803.839, 'end_time' => 809.1, 'target_text' => 'Yes, if you have the wealth and you want to just go to Makkah, you\'re not telling anyone the true reason, but you\'re saying,', 'source_text' => 'Ya, jika kalian ada wang dan ingin sekadar ke Makkah, kalian tidak memberitahu sesiapa sebab sebenarnya, tetapi kalian berkata,', 'order' => 237],
            ['start_time' => 809.2, 'end_time' => 814.7, 'target_text' => 'You know what, this Ramadan we\'re going to go to Makkah because you know, hey, it\'s a summer and you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah kamu, Ramadan kali ini kita akan ke Makkah kerana waktu ini musim panas, dan putaran', 'order' => 238],
            ['start_time' => 814.8, 'end_time' => 817.9, 'target_text' => 'This thing comes every uh 35 years.', 'source_text' => 'Musim sebegini hadir setiap 35 tahun sekali.', 'order' => 239],
            ['start_time' => 818.0, 'end_time' => 820.14, 'target_text' => 'It repeats itself, right?', 'source_text' => 'Ia berputar semula, bukan?', 'order' => 240],
            ['start_time' => 820.24, 'end_time' => 824.38, 'target_text' => 'Let me go and spend Ramadan in Makkah, you know, mashallah, and I saved up for it.', 'source_text' => 'Biarlah saya pergi menghabiskan Ramadan di Makkah, masha-Allah, dan saya sudah menyimpan wang untuknya.', 'order' => 241],
            ['start_time' => 824.48, 'end_time' => 825.02, 'target_text' => 'There\'s nothing wrong.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada salahnya.', 'order' => 242],
            ['start_time' => 825.12, 'end_time' => 827.58, 'target_text' => 'You went, alhamdulillah, it\'s permissible.', 'source_text' => 'Kalian pergi, alhamdulillah, ia dibolehkan.', 'order' => 243],
            ['start_time' => 827.68, 'end_time' => 831.419, 'target_text' => 'But I feel sorry for those who remain behind and that\'s the bulk.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi saya kasihan kepada mereka yang terus menetap di sini, dan itulah majoritinya.', 'order' => 244],
            ['start_time' => 831.519, 'end_time' => 834.38, 'target_text' => 'So every place has its positives and its negatives.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi setiap tempat mempunyai kelebihan dan kekurangannya yang tersendiri.', 'order' => 245],
            ['start_time' => 834.48, 'end_time' => 838.22, 'target_text' => 'So we have a challenge with our security and safety.', 'source_text' => 'Kami di sana menghadapi cabaran dari segi keselamatan.', 'order' => 246],
            ['start_time' => 838.32, 'end_time' => 840.7, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes we have other challenges.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala kami berdepan cabaran yang lain.', 'order' => 247],
            ['start_time' => 840.8, 'end_time' => 845.82, 'target_text' => 'We have challenges with perhaps some of the infrastructure and various other challenge.', 'source_text' => 'Kami berdepan cabaran prasarana dan pelbagai cabaran lain.', 'order' => 248],
            ['start_time' => 845.92, 'end_time' => 853.26, 'target_text' => 'And here you may have one major challenge and that is some of the extremes in some of the seasons but I\'m sure you\'ve been', 'source_text' => 'Dan di sini kalian mungkin menghadapi satu cabaran utama iaitu cuaca ekstrem pada sesetengah musim, tetapi saya pasti kalian telah biasa', 'order' => 249],
            ['start_time' => 853.36, 'end_time' => 855.02, 'target_text' => 'Navigating it for a long time.', 'source_text' => 'Menghadapinya sejak sekian lama.', 'order' => 250],
            ['start_time' => 855.12, 'end_time' => 856.78, 'target_text' => 'Do you know how to navigate it?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah kalian bagaimana cara menghadapinya dengan tenang?', 'order' => 251],
            ['start_time' => 856.88, 'end_time' => 859.34, 'target_text' => 'I can give you a a good tip.', 'source_text' => 'Saya boleh kongsikan satu tip yang baik.', 'order' => 252],
            ['start_time' => 859.44, 'end_time' => 863.5, 'target_text' => 'The good tip is look at those who have it worse like the Canadians.', 'source_text' => 'Tip terbaik adalah lihat mereka yang keadaannya jauh lebih teruk, seperti rakyat Kanada.', 'order' => 253],
            ['start_time' => 863.6, 'end_time' => 867.419, 'target_text' => 'Look at those in the northern part of Canada and just thank Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah mereka yang berada di bahagian utara Kanada dan bersyukurlah kepada Allah.', 'order' => 254],
            ['start_time' => 867.519, 'end_time' => 868.539, 'target_text' => 'Allah abar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 255],
            ['start_time' => 868.639, 'end_time' => 874.299, 'target_text' => 'When I hear the temperatures here are minus5, what\'s the coldest you get to in the winter?', 'source_text' => 'Bila saya mendengar suhu di sini mencecah negatif 5, berapakah suhu paling sejuk yang kalian alami ketika musim sejuk?', 'order' => 256],
            ['start_time' => 874.399, 'end_time' => 876.199, 'target_text' => '-5.', 'source_text' => 'Negatif 5.', 'order' => 257],
            ['start_time' => 877.36, 'end_time' => 884.78, 'target_text' => 'Go to the northern part of Canada and some parts of the states they will tell you minus whatever 50 - 45 - 30.', 'source_text' => 'Pergilah ke bahagian utara Kanada dan beberapa bahagian di Amerika, mereka akan memberitahu kalian negatif 50, negatif 45, negatif 30 darjah Celsius.', 'order' => 258],
            ['start_time' => 884.88, 'end_time' => 889.5, 'target_text' => 'And I\'m thinking, gosh, just when I thought it could never get any colder, here it is.', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya terfikir, ya ampun, tatkala saya menyangka tiada tempat yang lebih sejuk, rupa-rupanya ada yang jauh lebih ekstrem.', 'order' => 259],
            ['start_time' => 889.6, 'end_time' => 892.299, 'target_text' => 'May Allah almighty bless us.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Kuasa memberkati kita semua.', 'order' => 260],
            ['start_time' => 892.399, 'end_time' => 894.7, 'target_text' => 'So the Prophet ((sallallahu alaihi wasallam)) will recognize us.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu Nabi (sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam) akan mengenali kita.', 'order' => 261],
            ['start_time' => 894.8, 'end_time' => 902.46, 'target_text' => 'And when he recognizes us, we don\'t want to embarrass him because there will be people whom he will say, "Oh Allah, this person', 'source_text' => 'Dan apabila baginda mengenali kita, kita tidak mahu memalukan baginda kerana ada segelintir manusia yang mana baginda akan bersabda: Wahai Allah, orang ini', 'order' => 262],
            ['start_time' => 902.56, 'end_time' => 907.979, 'target_text' => 'Is from my Ummah." And Allah will say, "No, you don\'t know what they did after you left.', 'source_text' => 'Adalah daripada umatku. Namun Allah akan berfirman: Kamu tidak tahu apa yang mereka lakukan selepas ketiadaanmu.', 'order' => 263],
            ['start_time' => 908.079, 'end_time' => 910.14, 'target_text' => 'They turned away from your sunnah.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka telah berpaling daripada sunnahmu.', 'order' => 264],
            ['start_time' => 910.24, 'end_time' => 912.46, 'target_text' => 'They turned away from your ways.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka telah menyimpang daripada jalan petunjukmu.', 'order' => 265],
            ['start_time' => 912.56, 'end_time' => 915.72, 'target_text' => 'They turned away from your teachings.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka telah meninggalkan ajaranmu.', 'order' => 266],
            ['start_time' => 916.32, 'end_time' => 922.859, 'target_text' => 'So in a nutshell, it\'s up to us to continue to learn about the prophet Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wasallam).', 'source_text' => 'Maka kesimpulannya, terpulang kepada kita untuk terus mendalami sirah dan ajaran Nabi Muhammad (sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam).', 'order' => 267],
            ['start_time' => 922.959, 'end_time' => 930.859, 'target_text' => 'Do you know there are people who read about the prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) from the non-Muslims', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah kalian ada orang yang membaca mengenai Nabi Muhammad (peace be upon him) daripada kalangan bukan Islam', 'order' => 268],
            ['start_time' => 930.959, 'end_time' => 935.739, 'target_text' => 'And they said he was the greatest man ever to exist.', 'source_text' => 'Dan mereka memperakui bahawa baginda adalah insan teragung yang pernah wujud.', 'order' => 269],
            ['start_time' => 935.839, 'end_time' => 937.9, 'target_text' => 'The greatest man ever to exist.', 'source_text' => 'Insan paling hebat yang pernah hidup.', 'order' => 270],
            ['start_time' => 938.0, 'end_time' => 947.5, 'target_text' => 'Initially if you were to ask chat GPT questions it would answer you honestly but quickly when the fathers of chat GPT realized', 'source_text' => 'Pada peringkat awal jika kalian bertanya soalan kepada ChatGPT, ia akan menjawab secara jujur, namun sebaik sahaja pencipta ChatGPT menyedari', 'order' => 271],
            ['start_time' => 947.6, 'end_time' => 951.82, 'target_text' => 'That it\'s going to convert the whole world to Islam they change those answers.', 'source_text' => 'Bahawa ia berpotensi menarik seluruh dunia memeluk Islam, mereka segera mengubah jawapan-jawapan tersebut.', 'order' => 272],
            ['start_time' => 951.92, 'end_time' => 958.46, 'target_text' => 'I remember right at the beginning they were decisive answers tell us which is the correct religion.', 'source_text' => 'Saya masih ingat pada awalnya jawapannya sangat tegas: Beritahu kami apakah agama yang benar?', 'order' => 273],
            ['start_time' => 958.56, 'end_time' => 960.38, 'target_text' => 'It would let you know straight away Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Ia akan menjawab terus kepada kamu: Islam.', 'order' => 274],
            ['start_time' => 960.48, 'end_time' => 962.78, 'target_text' => 'No two ways no options.', 'source_text' => 'Tiada dolak-dalik, tiada pilihan berbelit.', 'order' => 275],
            ['start_time' => 962.88, 'end_time' => 964.62, 'target_text' => 'Now ask it which is the correct religion.', 'source_text' => 'Sekarang cubalah tanya agama apakah yang benar?', 'order' => 276],
            ['start_time' => 964.72, 'end_time' => 970.7, 'target_text' => 'It will tell you well it is a matter of discussion and a matter of preference and so on.', 'source_text' => 'Ia akan menjawab: Ia adalah perkara yang tertakluk kepada perbincangan, pilihan peribadi dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 277],
            ['start_time' => 970.8, 'end_time' => 973.179, 'target_text' => 'It gives you all these round answers round and round.', 'source_text' => 'Ia memberi jawapan berbelit-belit yang berputar ke sana ke mari.', 'order' => 278],
            ['start_time' => 973.279, 'end_time' => 976.06, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why I say be careful Allah abar.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah saya pesan berhati-hatilah, Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 279],
            ['start_time' => 976.16, 'end_time' => 979.419, 'target_text' => 'In Islam we believe in something known as a chain.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam Islam kita berpegang kepada satu asas kukuh yang dikenali sebagai sanad.', 'order' => 280],
            ['start_time' => 979.519, 'end_time' => 980.94, 'target_text' => 'A chain of narrators.', 'source_text' => 'Rantaian sanad para perawi.', 'order' => 281],
            ['start_time' => 981.04, 'end_time' => 984.14, 'target_text' => 'The most sacred chain ever to exist.', 'source_text' => 'Rantaian yang paling suci dan terjaga yang pernah wujud.', 'order' => 282],
            ['start_time' => 984.24, 'end_time' => 987.099, 'target_text' => 'How did the Quran come to you?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah Al-Quran sampai kepada kalian?', 'order' => 283],
            ['start_time' => 987.199, 'end_time' => 988.62, 'target_text' => 'How did the Quran come to you?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah Al-Quran disampaikan kepada kalian?', 'order' => 284],
            ['start_time' => 988.72, 'end_time' => 993.979, 'target_text' => 'Was it not revealed by Allah through Gibl to the prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him)?', 'source_text' => 'Bukankah ia diwahyukan oleh Allah melalui Malaikat Jibril kepada Nabi Muhammad (peace be upon him)?', 'order' => 285],
            ['start_time' => 994.079, 'end_time' => 997.02, 'target_text' => 'And did he not recite it?', 'source_text' => 'Dan bukankah baginda membacakannya?', 'order' => 286],
            ['start_time' => 997.12, 'end_time' => 1000.62, 'target_text' => 'And did the Sahabah not memorize it?', 'source_text' => 'Dan bukankah para Sahabat menghafalnya?', 'order' => 287],
            ['start_time' => 1000.72, 'end_time' => 1004.299, 'target_text' => 'One might ask, why didn\'t they write it down straight away?', 'source_text' => 'Ada orang mungkin bertanya, mengapakah mereka tidak menuliskannya secara bertulis serta-merta?', 'order' => 288],
            ['start_time' => 1004.399, 'end_time' => 1009.72, 'target_text' => 'Well, for the same reason that they didn\'t put it on the internet straight away.', 'source_text' => 'Sebabnya sama persis seperti mengapa mereka tidak memuat naiknya ke internet secara langsung ketika itu.', 'order' => 289],
            ['start_time' => 1010.24, 'end_time' => 1012.38, 'target_text' => 'Did you understand what I just said?', 'source_text' => 'Fahamkah kalian apa yang baru saya katakan?', 'order' => 290],
            ['start_time' => 1012.48, 'end_time' => 1013.659, 'target_text' => 'Same reason.', 'source_text' => 'Alasannya sama sahaja.', 'order' => 291],
            ['start_time' => 1013.759, 'end_time' => 1016.92, 'target_text' => 'Because at that time, Allah says', 'source_text' => 'Kerana pada zaman tersebut, Allah berfirman:', 'order' => 292],
            ['start_time' => 1022.32, 'end_time' => 1024.6, 'target_text' => 'Allah sent', 'source_text' => 'Dialah yang mengutuskan', 'order' => 293],
            ['start_time' => 1025.6, 'end_time' => 1029.339, 'target_text' => 'Among the unlettered a messenger from them.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam kalangan kaum yang ummi seorang Rasul dari bangsa mereka sendiri.', 'order' => 294],
            ['start_time' => 1029.439, 'end_time' => 1032.06, 'target_text' => 'Unleted meaning they never used to read and write.', 'source_text' => 'Ummi bermaksud mereka pada lazimnya tidak membaca dan menulis.', 'order' => 295],
            ['start_time' => 1032.16, 'end_time' => 1033.979, 'target_text' => 'Reading and writing was not an in thing.', 'source_text' => 'Membaca dan menulis bukanlah amalan kelaziman mereka.', 'order' => 296],
            ['start_time' => 1034.079, 'end_time' => 1036.54, 'target_text' => 'It was not something they gave preference to.', 'source_text' => 'Ia bukanlah sesuatu yang menjadi keutamaan budaya mereka.', 'order' => 297],
            ['start_time' => 1036.64, 'end_time' => 1040.3, 'target_text' => 'So most of the people, most of them could not read or write.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kebanyakan masyarakat, majoriti mereka tidak tahu membaca atau menulis.', 'order' => 298],
            ['start_time' => 1040.4, 'end_time' => 1043.02, 'target_text' => 'So how would you ask them why didn\'t you write it down?', 'source_text' => 'Lalu bagaimana kalian hendak mempersoalkan mengapa kalian tidak menuliskannya?', 'order' => 299],
            ['start_time' => 1043.12, 'end_time' => 1044.3, 'target_text' => 'They will tell you we don\'t write.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka akan menjawab: Kami tidak menulis.', 'order' => 300],
            ['start_time' => 1044.4, 'end_time' => 1045.18, 'target_text' => 'We memorize.', 'source_text' => 'Kami menghafal di dalam dada.', 'order' => 301],
            ['start_time' => 1045.28, 'end_time' => 1050.62, 'target_text' => 'They used to memorize the lineages of their camels up to 10 generations.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mampu menghafal jurai keturunan unta-unta mereka sehingga 10 keturunan terdahulu.', 'order' => 302],
            ['start_time' => 1050.72, 'end_time' => 1054.62, 'target_text' => 'We do not know our own lineage up to 10 generations.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sendiri tidak tahu jurai keturunan kita sehingga 10 keturunan ke belakang.', 'order' => 303],
            ['start_time' => 1054.72, 'end_time' => 1061.98, 'target_text' => 'Any one of you can stand up and tell me your name and your forefather\'s name 10 fathers back, I will give you an award tonight.', 'source_text' => 'Jika ada sesiapa antara kalian boleh berdiri dan menyebut nama sendiri serta nama moyang kalian 10 generasi ke atas, saya beri anugerah malam ini.', 'order' => 304],
            ['start_time' => 1062.08, 'end_time' => 1063.9, 'target_text' => 'Stand up.', 'source_text' => 'Sila berdiri.', 'order' => 305],
            ['start_time' => 1064.0, 'end_time' => 1065.26, 'target_text' => 'Anyone?', 'source_text' => 'Ada sesiapa?', 'order' => 306],
            ['start_time' => 1065.36, 'end_time' => 1071.42, 'target_text' => 'So, we cannot compete with those who knew the lineages of their own camels, let alone themselves.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, kita tidak mampu menandingi mereka yang menghafal keturunan unta mereka, apatah lagi keturunan mereka sendiri.', 'order' => 307],
            ['start_time' => 1071.52, 'end_time' => 1075.819, 'target_text' => 'With their lineages, they could take it all the way back to Adam.', 'source_text' => 'Dengan keturunan mereka, mereka boleh menjejak salasilah sehingga kembali kepada Nabi Adam.', 'order' => 308],
            ['start_time' => 1075.919, 'end_time' => 1085.5, 'target_text' => 'Alisam with us my brother I know about maybe six of them seven of them max and then who\'s there after that wall Allah knows', 'source_text' => '\'Alaihissalam. Bagi kita, wahai saudaraku, saya hanya tahu mungkin enam atau paling banyak tujuh generasi, dan selepas itu siapa lagi? Wallahu a\'lam,', 'order' => 309],
            ['start_time' => 1085.6, 'end_time' => 1094.62, 'target_text' => 'Best and I see some of the brothers here and I think you know what we look alike perhaps somewhere up our DNA we must be related', 'source_text' => 'Dan saya melihat beberapa orang saudara di sini dan saya terfikir, kalian tahu rupa kita seiras, mungkin di suatu titik DNA kita sebenarnya bersaudara.', 'order' => 310],
            ['start_time' => 1094.72, 'end_time' => 1102.459, 'target_text' => 'Do you think it\'s true you guys think it\'s true the uncle saying no uncle I expected better from you Akbar like it or not', 'source_text' => 'Adakah kalian rasa ia benar? Pak cik di sana menggeleng kepala: Tidak pak cik, saya harapkan jawapan lebih baik dari pak cik, suka atau tidak,', 'order' => 311],
            ['start_time' => 1102.559, 'end_time' => 1105.42, 'target_text' => 'Lump it I\'m related to you uncle you No.', 'source_text' => 'Terimalah hakikat ini, saya ada pertalian darah dengan pak cik!', 'order' => 312],
            ['start_time' => 1105.52, 'end_time' => 1109.5, 'target_text' => 'Can I tell you how is Adam not our father?', 'source_text' => 'Bolehkah saya buktikan: bukankah Nabi Adam adalah bapa kita semua?', 'order' => 313],
            ['start_time' => 1109.6, 'end_time' => 1110.0, 'target_text' => 'Come on.', 'source_text' => 'Fikirkanlah.', 'order' => 314],
            ['start_time' => 1110.08, 'end_time' => 1111.26, 'target_text' => 'We\'re all related.', 'source_text' => 'Kita semua bersaudara.', 'order' => 315],
            ['start_time' => 1111.36, 'end_time' => 1114.3, 'target_text' => 'We\'re cousins and and we\'re we\'re family, man.', 'source_text' => 'Kita adalah sepupu dan kita adalah satu keluarga besar.', 'order' => 316],
            ['start_time' => 1114.4, 'end_time' => 1115.74, 'target_text' => 'Mashallah.', 'source_text' => 'Masha-Allah.', 'order' => 317],
            ['start_time' => 1115.84, 'end_time' => 1116.699, 'target_text' => 'No.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak.', 'order' => 318],
            ['start_time' => 1116.799, 'end_time' => 1121.98, 'target_text' => 'And even much later than that, we\'re connected inshallah by the will of Allah somehow.', 'source_text' => 'Malah jauh selepas itu pun, kita saling terhubung insya-Allah dengan kehendak Allah dalam suatu cara.', 'order' => 319],
            ['start_time' => 1122.08, 'end_time' => 1123.9, 'target_text' => 'It\'s just that we don\'t know.', 'source_text' => 'Cuma kita sahaja yang tidak mengetahuinya.', 'order' => 320],
            ['start_time' => 1124.0, 'end_time' => 1129.26, 'target_text' => 'You know, you have cousins, they will have children, second cousin, third cousin.', 'source_text' => 'Kalian tahu, kalian mempunyai sepupu, mereka mempunyai anak, sepupu darjat kedua, sepupu darjat ketiga.', 'order' => 321],
            ['start_time' => 1129.36, 'end_time' => 1134.939, 'target_text' => 'By the time you get to a fourth cousin, you will need to document it to know your relatives.', 'source_text' => 'Menjelang kalian sampai kepada sepupu darjat keempat, kalian perlu mencatatnya untuk mengenali sanak saudara kalian.', 'order' => 322],
            ['start_time' => 1135.039, 'end_time' => 1136.38, 'target_text' => 'Otherwise, you won\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Jika tidak, kalian tidak akan mengetahuinya.', 'order' => 323],
            ['start_time' => 1136.48, 'end_time' => 1139.5, 'target_text' => 'And you\'ll be surprised this person is related to me because you know what?', 'source_text' => 'Dan kalian akan terkejut bahawa orang ini ada pertalian dengan saya kerana tahukah kalian?', 'order' => 324],
            ['start_time' => 1139.6, 'end_time' => 1143.42, 'target_text' => 'When you get to a fourth cousin, you\'re related in 16 different ways.', 'source_text' => 'Bila kalian sampai ke darjat sepupu keempat, kalian terhubung melalui 16 jurai berbeza.', 'order' => 325],
            ['start_time' => 1143.52, 'end_time' => 1144.86, 'target_text' => '16 different people are involved.', 'source_text' => '16 individu yang berbeza terlibat.', 'order' => 326],
            ['start_time' => 1144.96, 'end_time' => 1147.98, 'target_text' => 'Now, Allah Akbar, may Allah bless us.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar, semoga Allah memberkati kita.', 'order' => 327],
            ['start_time' => 1148.08, 'end_time' => 1149.74, 'target_text' => 'Allah grant us goodness.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah mengurniakan kebaikan kepada kita.', 'order' => 328],
            ['start_time' => 1149.84, 'end_time' => 1156.3, 'target_text' => 'So, this is why we say there is a chain of narrators that brings the Quran to us, brought the Quran to us.', 'source_text' => 'Sebab itulah kami katakan terdapat rantaian perawi (sanad) yang menyampaikan Al-Quran kepada kita.', 'order' => 329],
            ['start_time' => 1156.4, 'end_time' => 1160.38, 'target_text' => 'That is the same chain of narrators that brought the hadith to us.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah rantaian perawi yang sama yang menyampaikan hadis kepada kita.', 'order' => 330],
            ['start_time' => 1160.48, 'end_time' => 1164.38, 'target_text' => 'So if you want to deny one, why do you accept the other one?', 'source_text' => 'Jadi jika kalian ingin menolak salah satunya, mengapakah kalian menerima yang satu lagi?', 'order' => 331],
            ['start_time' => 1164.48, 'end_time' => 1165.66, 'target_text' => 'Make sense?', 'source_text' => 'Masuk akal bukan?', 'order' => 332],
            ['start_time' => 1165.76, 'end_time' => 1168.86, 'target_text' => 'They say, well, that one was documented earlier than this one.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka berkata, Al-Quran didokumentasikan lebih awal berbanding hadis.', 'order' => 333],
            ['start_time' => 1168.96, 'end_time' => 1169.74, 'target_text' => 'You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah kalian?', 'order' => 334],
            ['start_time' => 1169.84, 'end_time' => 1172.06, 'target_text' => 'It was still carried by the same men.', 'source_text' => 'Ia tetap diriwayatkan dan dibawa oleh perawi yang sama.', 'order' => 335],
            ['start_time' => 1172.16, 'end_time' => 1173.42, 'target_text' => 'And yes, I do agree.', 'source_text' => 'Dan ya, saya amat bersetuju.', 'order' => 336],
            ['start_time' => 1173.52, 'end_time' => 1175.98, 'target_text' => 'The Quran unchanged.', 'source_text' => 'Al-Quran terpelihara tanpa sebarang perubahan.', 'order' => 337],
            ['start_time' => 1176.08, 'end_time' => 1182.06, 'target_text' => 'One might argue, and when I say one might argue, I\'m talking of Tik Tok and Instagram and all those who want to sit and talk', 'source_text' => 'Ada orang cuba berhujah, dan apabila saya sebut orang cuba berhujah, saya maksudkan di TikTok dan Instagram dan mereka yang gemar duduk bercakap', 'order' => 338],
            ['start_time' => 1182.16, 'end_time' => 1184.939, 'target_text' => 'About the prophet as though they are the biggest scholars on earth.', 'source_text' => 'Mengenai Nabi seolah-olah merekalah ulama paling hebat di atas muka bumi.', 'order' => 339],
            ['start_time' => 1185.039, 'end_time' => 1186.14, 'target_text' => 'They don\'t even know anything.', 'source_text' => 'Sedangkan mereka langsung tidak tahu apa-apa.', 'order' => 340],
            ['start_time' => 1186.24, 'end_time' => 1189.819, 'target_text' => 'They talk about hadith like they are sheh hadith but they don\'t even know.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka bercakap mengenai hadis seolah-olah mereka Syaikhul Hadith tetapi mereka langsung jahil.', 'order' => 341],
            ['start_time' => 1189.919, 'end_time' => 1192.22, 'target_text' => 'They haven\'t memorized even 10 hadith.', 'source_text' => 'Menghafal 10 hadis pun mereka belum pernah.', 'order' => 342],
            ['start_time' => 1192.32, 'end_time' => 1192.86, 'target_text' => 'They haven\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tidak hafal.', 'order' => 343],
            ['start_time' => 1192.96, 'end_time' => 1199.26, 'target_text' => 'And these people are talking and giving you dean and making you doubt your faith just because they are sitting on tick tock.', 'source_text' => 'Dan orang-orang sebegini bercakap mengajar kamu tentang agama dan membuatkan kamu meragui keimanan kamu semata-mata kerana mereka bersiaran di TikTok.', 'order' => 344],
            ['start_time' => 1199.36, 'end_time' => 1200.38, 'target_text' => 'Allah abar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 345],
            ['start_time' => 1200.48, 'end_time' => 1202.939, 'target_text' => 'And time is ticking and talking.', 'source_text' => 'Dan masa terus berlalu detik demi detik.', 'order' => 346],
            ['start_time' => 1203.039, 'end_time' => 1204.38, 'target_text' => 'Allah abar.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar.', 'order' => 347],
            ['start_time' => 1204.48, 'end_time' => 1206.3, 'target_text' => 'Don\'t allow that to brainwash you.', 'source_text' => 'Jangan biarkan dakyah itu mencuci otak kalian.', 'order' => 348],
            ['start_time' => 1206.4, 'end_time' => 1208.3, 'target_text' => 'Ask yourself who\'s this person?', 'source_text' => 'Tanyalah diri kalian, siapakah orang ini?', 'order' => 349],
            ['start_time' => 1208.4, 'end_time' => 1210.06, 'target_text' => 'How many hadith have they memorized?', 'source_text' => 'Berapa banyak hadis yang telah dia hafal?', 'order' => 350],
            ['start_time' => 1210.16, 'end_time' => 1217.66, 'target_text' => 'They\'re speaking and there are thousands and millions of men who are who have studied the hadith in and out and they brought', 'source_text' => 'Dia bercakap sedangkan ada ribuan dan jutaan ulama yang mengkaji hadis luar dan dalam lalu meriwayatkannya', 'order' => 351],
            ['start_time' => 1217.76, 'end_time' => 1220.22, 'target_text' => 'It down generations and it\'s a study.', 'source_text' => 'Turun-temurun merentasi generasi dan ia adalah disiplin ilmu yang amat teliti.', 'order' => 352],
            ['start_time' => 1220.32, 'end_time' => 1225.1, 'target_text' => 'Surely those right at the beginning would have knocked out all these a hadith if they were false.', 'source_text' => 'Pasti para ulama terdahulu sudah menolak hadis-hadis ini jika ia sememangnya palsu.', 'order' => 353],
            ['start_time' => 1225.2, 'end_time' => 1230.62, 'target_text' => 'Why is it that 1500 years down we think we know more than those people Allah Akbar?', 'source_text' => 'Mengapakah selepas 1500 tahun kita menyangka kita lebih tahu daripada ulama agung tersebut, Allahu Akbar?', 'order' => 354],
            ['start_time' => 1230.72, 'end_time' => 1231.42, 'target_text' => 'They lived it.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka menghayati kehidupan itu.', 'order' => 355],
            ['start_time' => 1231.52, 'end_time' => 1234.38, 'target_text' => 'They were there in front of the prophet (peace be upon him).', 'source_text' => 'Mereka hidup di hadapan Baginda Nabi (peace be upon him).', 'order' => 356],
            ['start_time' => 1234.48, 'end_time' => 1237.4, 'target_text' => 'Here is Abu Bakr a', 'source_text' => 'Lihatlah Saiyidina Abu Bakar', 'order' => 357],
            ['start_time' => 1238.48, 'end_time' => 1246.699, 'target_text' => 'When the prophet Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) came back from the mi the ascension to heaven the kufur of Quraysh were', 'source_text' => 'Apabila Nabi Muhammad (sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam) kembali daripada peristiwa Mikraj, pengangkatan ke langit, orang kafir Quraisy', 'order' => 358],
            ['start_time' => 1246.799, 'end_time' => 1252.38, 'target_text' => 'Laughing they say what do you think of a man who claims to have gone all the way to Makkah and then all the way up to the', 'source_text' => 'Mentertawakan baginda, mereka berkata: Apakah pandanganmu tentang seorang lelaki yang mendakwa pergi ke Baitulmaqdis kemudian naik ke', 'order' => 359],
            ['start_time' => 1252.48, 'end_time' => 1260.3, 'target_text' => 'Heavens and come back the same night and so obviously the answer would be hey you know what no ordinary human would be able', 'source_text' => 'Langit dan kembali semula pada malam yang sama? Sudah tentu jawapan logik manusia biasa ialah: Tiada manusia biasa mampu melakukannya.', 'order' => 360],
            ['start_time' => 1260.4, 'end_time' => 1263.42, 'target_text' => 'To do that but Abu Bakr', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi Abu Bakar', 'order' => 361],
            ['start_time' => 1263.52, 'end_time' => 1266.28, 'target_text' => 'Became known known as', 'source_text' => 'Digelarkan sebagai As-Siddiq', 'order' => 362],
            ['start_time' => 1266.4, 'end_time' => 1273.5, 'target_text' => 'According to some narrations because he said if this man said it then I believe it', 'source_text' => 'Menurut sebahagian riwayat kerana beliau menegaskan: Jika lelaki ini yang mengatakannya, maka aku mempercayainya sepenuhnya!', 'order' => 363],
            ['start_time' => 1273.6, 'end_time' => 1282.3, 'target_text' => 'If this man said it I believe it and then he explains that this man here is no child he was 50 at the time approximately and', 'source_text' => 'Jika baginda yang mengatakannya, aku percaya! Dan beliau menjelaskan bahawa lelaki ini bukan budak mentah, usianya sekitar 50 tahun ketika itu dan', 'order' => 364],
            ['start_time' => 1282.4, 'end_time' => 1291.1, 'target_text' => 'He hadn\'t lied all his life now normally people here on earth they lie to earn a little bit of a of a dollar you\'re selling', 'source_text' => 'Baginda tidak pernah berbohong seumur hidupnya. Pada kebiasaannya manusia di bumi berbohong demi mengaut sedikit keuntungan wang, kamu menjual', 'order' => 365],
            ['start_time' => 1291.2, 'end_time' => 1297.26, 'target_text' => 'A car you say it\'s never been involved in an accident and deep down you know it\'s it has been right why because you want to', 'source_text' => 'Sebuah kereta, kamu kata kereta ini tidak pernah kemalangan sedangkan di sudut hati kamu tahu ia pernah terlibat kemalangan, mengapa? Kerana kamu ingin', 'order' => 366],
            ['start_time' => 1297.36, 'end_time' => 1303.66, 'target_text' => 'Make a few pounds more and sometimes people say wahi that\'s my cost don\'t do that but people say that\'s my cost and they\'re', 'source_text' => 'Untung beberapa paun lebih, dan kadangkala ada yang berkata: Demi Allah itulah harga modal saya! Jangan buat begitu, orang berdusta kononnya itulah modal mereka', 'order' => 367],
            ['start_time' => 1303.76, 'end_time' => 1311.1, 'target_text' => 'Lying it\'s not your cost just tell people pay the price or it\'s the best I can do instead of lying about it but people lie', 'source_text' => 'Padahal mereka berbohong. Itu bukan modal kamu, berterus-teranglah bayar harga sekian atau itulah harga terbaik yang saya mampu beri daripada kamu menipu, tetapi manusia tetap menipu.', 'order' => 368],
            ['start_time' => 1311.2, 'end_time' => 1319.579, 'target_text' => 'But the prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) never ever lied about the dunya about worldly matters Abu Bakr says', 'source_text' => 'Namun Nabi Muhammad (peace be upon him) tidak pernah sesekali berbohong mengenai urusan dunia! Abu Bakar menegaskan:', 'order' => 369],
            ['start_time' => 1319.679, 'end_time' => 1325.34, 'target_text' => 'If he didn\'t lie about worldly matters what makes you think He\'s going to lie about the heavenly matters.', 'source_text' => 'Jika baginda tidak pernah berbohong tentang perkara dunia, apa yang membuatkan kamu fikir baginda akan berbohong tentang perkara samawi?', 'order' => 370],
            ['start_time' => 1325.44, 'end_time' => 1326.3, 'target_text' => 'He won\'t.', 'source_text' => 'Baginda tidak akan sesekali berbohong.', 'order' => 371],
            ['start_time' => 1326.4, 'end_time' => 1329.1, 'target_text' => 'So if he told you I went, I believe he went.', 'source_text' => 'Maka jika baginda memberitahu kamu baginda pergi, aku yakin baginda benar-benar pergi.', 'order' => 372],
            ['start_time' => 1329.2, 'end_time' => 1329.599, 'target_text' => 'How?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimana caranya?', 'order' => 373],
            ['start_time' => 1329.6, 'end_time' => 1331.959, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t care how.', 'source_text' => 'Aku tidak peduli bagaimana caranya.', 'order' => 374],
            ['start_time' => 1332.559, 'end_time' => 1335.479, 'target_text' => 'That is called im faith.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah yang dinamakan iman yang sejati.', 'order' => 375],
            ['start_time' => 1335.76, 'end_time' => 1340.459, 'target_text' => 'We are being told that these are the words of the Prophet ((sallallahu alaihi wasallam)) with a chain OF NARRATORS.', 'source_text' => 'Kita diberitahu bahawa ini adalah sabda Nabi (sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam) dengan rantaian sanad perawi yang sahih,', 'order' => 376],
            ['start_time' => 1340.559, 'end_time' => 1343.32, 'target_text' => 'AND STILL WE don\'t believe.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kita masih ragu-ragu dan tidak percaya.', 'order' => 377],
            ['start_time' => 1343.44, 'end_time' => 1346.92, 'target_text' => 'Still some people want to argue how.', 'source_text' => 'Masih ada yang mahu mempertikaikan bagaimana caranya.', 'order' => 378],
            ['start_time' => 1347.36, 'end_time' => 1352.459, 'target_text' => 'So we\'re not denying that the Quran mashallah is preserved in a far greater way.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kita tidak menafikan bahawa Al-Quran masha-Allah terpelihara dengan darjah ketelitian yang jauh lebih tinggi.', 'order' => 379],
            ['start_time' => 1352.559, 'end_time' => 1353.42, 'target_text' => 'No doubt.', 'source_text' => 'Tidak diragukan lagi.', 'order' => 380],
            ['start_time' => 1353.52, 'end_time' => 1358.14, 'target_text' => 'And the Quran is the word of Allah given to us by Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wasallam).', 'source_text' => 'Dan Al-Quran adalah kalam Allah yang disampaikan kepada kita oleh Nabi Muhammad (sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam).', 'order' => 381],
            ['start_time' => 1358.24, 'end_time' => 1359.34, 'target_text' => 'I know the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Saya mengenali Al-Quran.', 'order' => 382],
            ['start_time' => 1359.44, 'end_time' => 1363.34, 'target_text' => 'You know the Quran because of Muhammad may (peace be upon him).', 'source_text' => 'Kalian mengenali Al-Quran berkat Nabi Muhammad (peace be upon him).', 'order' => 383],
            ['start_time' => 1363.44, 'end_time' => 1367.1, 'target_text' => 'If it wasn\'t for Muhammad, (peace be upon him), we would not know the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Jikalau bukan kerana Muhammad (peace be upon him), nescaya kita tidak akan mengenali Al-Quran.', 'order' => 384],
            ['start_time' => 1367.2, 'end_time' => 1369.579, 'target_text' => 'The same Muhammad explained the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Muhammad yang sama itulah yang menerangkan isi kandungan Al-Quran.', 'order' => 385],
            ['start_time' => 1369.679, 'end_time' => 1373.5, 'target_text' => 'And that explanation was carried by the same men who carried the Quran.', 'source_text' => 'Dan penjelasan hadis tersebut dibawa oleh para perawi yang sama yang meriwayatkan Al-Quran.', 'order' => 386],
            ['start_time' => 1373.6, 'end_time' => 1380.14, 'target_text' => 'And so therefore, you need to know, my beloved brothers and sisters, that yes, the wording of the Quran totally sacred.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh yang demikian, kalian perlu faham, wahai saudara-saudariku yang dikasihi, bahawa ya, lafaz Al-Quran sepenuhnya suci mutlak.', 'order' => 387],
            ['start_time' => 1380.24, 'end_time' => 1390.059, 'target_text' => 'The hadith I do agree it may not have been given that amount of importance but it is carried with a chain of narrators that', 'source_text' => 'Hadis pula saya akui mungkin ada yang tidak diletakkan darjat yang sama tinggi tetapi ia dibawa dengan rantaian sanad', 'order' => 388],
            ['start_time' => 1390.159, 'end_time' => 1393.42, 'target_text' => 'You can study and they have been studied from the beginning.', 'source_text' => 'Yang boleh kalian kaji dan ia sememangnya telah disaring sejak awal lagi.', 'order' => 389],
            ['start_time' => 1393.52, 'end_time' => 1401.02, 'target_text' => 'So you will note that some of the a hadith the scholars and the experts have said this hadith is fabricated this one is weak.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kalian akan dapati ulama dan pakar hadis menjelaskan hadis ini mauduk (palsu), hadis ini daif (lemah).', 'order' => 390],
            ['start_time' => 1401.12, 'end_time' => 1405.98, 'target_text' => 'We agree we don\'t deny that there are a few that are fabricated a few that are weak.', 'source_text' => 'Kita bersetuju, kita tidak menafikan ada sebahagian kecil hadis yang palsu dan ada yang lemah.', 'order' => 391],
            ['start_time' => 1406.08, 'end_time' => 1407.26, 'target_text' => 'We\'ve never denied that.', 'source_text' => 'Kita tidak pernah menyangkal hakikat itu.', 'order' => 392],
            ['start_time' => 1407.36, 'end_time' => 1408.86, 'target_text' => 'The experts have mentioned it.', 'source_text' => 'Para pakar hadis telah memperincikannya.', 'order' => 393],
            ['start_time' => 1408.96, 'end_time' => 1416.939, 'target_text' => 'But the point you need to know, you cannot deny all the hadith because there\'s a small percentage that are weak or fabricated.', 'source_text' => 'Namun perkara pokok yang wajib kalian fahami, kalian tidak boleh menolak seluruh hadis semata-mata kerana terdapat peratusan kecil hadis yang lemah atau palsu.', 'order' => 394],
            ['start_time' => 1417.039, 'end_time' => 1418.939, 'target_text' => 'That\'s what I want to say.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah perkara yang ingin saya tegaskan.', 'order' => 395],
            ['start_time' => 1419.039, 'end_time' => 1423.9, 'target_text' => 'Otherwise, you wouldn\'t be able to do 90% of what you\'re doing as a Muslim.', 'source_text' => 'Jika kalian menolak hadis, kalian tidak akan mampu melaksanakan 90% daripada syariat yang kalian amalkan sebagai seorang Muslim.', 'order' => 396],
            ['start_time' => 1424.0, 'end_time' => 1427.98, 'target_text' => 'So, what the enemy is doing right now, they want to delete the whole of Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi apa yang cuba dilakukan oleh musuh sekarang, mereka mahu melupuskan seluruh ajaran Islam.', 'order' => 397],
            ['start_time' => 1428.08, 'end_time' => 1431.1, 'target_text' => 'They want to shake the hadith, the whole of hadith.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka mahu menggugat autoriti hadis, menghapuskan hadis keseluruhannya.', 'order' => 398],
            ['start_time' => 1431.2, 'end_time' => 1433.9, 'target_text' => 'Once you remove hadith, you\'ve removed Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Sebaik sahaja kamu membuang hadis, kamu sebenarnya telah meruntuhkan Islam.', 'order' => 399],
            ['start_time' => 1434.0, 'end_time' => 1438.62, 'target_text' => 'And you find people who look extremely intelligent and they pick on a few things.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kamu dapati orang yang kelihatan sangat cerdik sengaja mengungkit beberapa perkara terpencil.', 'order' => 400],
            ['start_time' => 1438.72, 'end_time' => 1440.059, 'target_text' => 'How old was Aisha?', 'source_text' => 'Berapakah usia Saidatina Aisyah?', 'order' => 401],
            ['start_time' => 1440.159, 'end_time' => 1446.3, 'target_text' => 'For example, I tell you what, if you died without knowing, it would never have affected your iman and your possibility of', 'source_text' => 'Sebagai contoh, saya beritahu kalian, sekiranya kalian meninggal dunia tanpa mengetahui jawapannya, ia tidak sesekali menjejaskan iman dan peluang kalian', 'order' => 402],
            ['start_time' => 1446.4, 'end_time' => 1450.22, 'target_text' => 'Going into Jenna because there is no religious relevance of the age.', 'source_text' => 'Untuk masuk ke dalam syurga kerana tiada hukum agama yang bersandarkan kepada ketetapan umur tersebut.', 'order' => 403],
            ['start_time' => 1450.32, 'end_time' => 1458.14, 'target_text' => 'And we don\'t know the ages of any of the other wives of the prophet (peace be upon him) besides Khadijah and with Khadijah there', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita bahkan tidak tahu umur mana-mana isteri Nabi (peace be upon him) yang lain selain Khadijah, dan tentang Khadijah pun', 'order' => 404],
            ['start_time' => 1458.24, 'end_time' => 1459.5, 'target_text' => 'Is a debate with Aisha.', 'source_text' => 'Ada perbahasan, sebagaimana tentang Aisyah.', 'order' => 405],
            ['start_time' => 1459.6, 'end_time' => 1461.42, 'target_text' => 'There is a debate regarding the age.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat perbezaan pandangan mengenai usia baginda.', 'order' => 406],
            ['start_time' => 1461.52, 'end_time' => 1465.16, 'target_text' => 'That shows you that the age is irrelevant.', 'source_text' => 'Itu membuktikan bahawa umur itu sendiri bukan penentu akidah.', 'order' => 407],
            ['start_time' => 1465.76, 'end_time' => 1470.459, 'target_text' => 'How did it affect my connection with Allah knowing or not knowing whether', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah ia menjejaskan hubungan saya dengan Allah sama ada mengetahui atau tidak tahu sama ada Saidatina Khadijah', 'order' => 408],
            ['start_time' => 1470.559, 'end_time' => 1472.62, 'target_text' => 'Was actually 40 or 28?', 'source_text' => 'Sebenarnya berusia 40 atau 28 tahun?', 'order' => 409],
            ['start_time' => 1472.72, 'end_time' => 1474.22, 'target_text' => 'Some of the people say 28.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian sejarawan menyatakan 28 tahun.', 'order' => 410],
            ['start_time' => 1474.32, 'end_time' => 1477.9, 'target_text' => 'She was 28 and they give a lot of evidence for it.', 'source_text' => 'Beliau berusia 28 tahun dan mereka mengemukakan banyak dalil mengenainya.', 'order' => 411],
            ['start_time' => 1478.0, 'end_time' => 1479.579, 'target_text' => 'So', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian', 'order' => 412],
            ['start_time' => 1479.679, 'end_time' => 1482.86, 'target_text' => 'Some of the scholars say she was 18 and they give some evidence for it.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian ulama menyatakan Saidatina Aisyah berusia 18 tahun dan mereka kemukakan dalilnya.', 'order' => 413],
            ['start_time' => 1482.96, 'end_time' => 1484.62, 'target_text' => 'Some of them say she was much younger.', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian lain menyatakan beliau lebih muda daripada itu.', 'order' => 414],
            ['start_time' => 1484.72, 'end_time' => 1485.579, 'target_text' => 'They give evidence for it.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka membawa bukti mereka.', 'order' => 415],
            ['start_time' => 1485.679, 'end_time' => 1488.38, 'target_text' => 'I tell you what, if someone said, "You know what?', 'source_text' => 'Saya beritahu kalian, jika seseorang berkata: Tahukah kamu,', 'order' => 416],
            ['start_time' => 1488.48, 'end_time' => 1491.5, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t know." you will still go to Jenna.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak tahu secara pasti, kamu tetap akan masuk ke dalam syurga.', 'order' => 417],
            ['start_time' => 1491.6, 'end_time' => 1494.62, 'target_text' => 'So they pick on these things and they say look at this, look at that.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi musuh sengaja memilih isu-isu sebegini dan berkata: Lihatlah perkara ini, lihatlah itu.', 'order' => 418],
            ['start_time' => 1494.72, 'end_time' => 1500.86, 'target_text' => 'They\'ll pick on 10 or 20 things and because of those 10 or 20 things they want to take away the whole of the prophet Muhammad', 'source_text' => 'Mereka akan memilih 10 atau 20 isu, dan disebabkan 10 atau 20 perkara itu mereka mahu melenyapkan seluruh sirah Nabi Muhammad', 'order' => 419],
            ['start_time' => 1500.96, 'end_time' => 1506.86, 'target_text' => '(sallallahu alaihi wasallam)\'s life and his words and his character and his conduct and the way he spoke and the way he or he', 'source_text' => '(Sallallahu \'alaihi wasallam), sabda baginda, akhlak mulia baginda, keperibadian baginda, cara baginda berbicara dan cara baginda', 'order' => 420],
            ['start_time' => 1506.96, 'end_time' => 1509.579, 'target_text' => 'Did whatever he did take it all away from you.', 'source_text' => 'Melakukan segala amalan, mereka mahu merampas semuanya daripada diri kalian.', 'order' => 421],
            ['start_time' => 1509.679, 'end_time' => 1512.699, 'target_text' => 'May Allah almighty protect us all.', 'source_text' => 'Semoga Allah Yang Maha Berkuasa melindungi kita semua.', 'order' => 422],
            ['start_time' => 1512.799, 'end_time' => 1515.1, 'target_text' => 'My brothers and sisters,', 'source_text' => 'Saudara dan saudariku sekalian,', 'order' => 423],
            ['start_time' => 1515.2, 'end_time' => 1517.959, 'target_text' => 'As much as this is Ra', 'source_text' => 'Walaupun kita berada di penghujung Ramadan,', 'order' => 424],
            ['start_time' => 1518.32, 'end_time' => 1521.9, 'target_text' => 'And we are seated in this beautiful masid of Dandi', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita sedang duduk di dalam masjid Dundee yang indah ini,', 'order' => 425],
            ['start_time' => 1522.0, 'end_time' => 1531.179, 'target_text' => 'With such vast numbers of young people and brothers and sisters, I tell you pray that Allah grant us all the highest strengths', 'source_text' => 'Bersama bilangan anak muda, saudara dan saudari yang begitu ramai, saya menyeru berdoalah agar Allah mengurniakan kita tingkatan tertinggi', 'order' => 426],
            ['start_time' => 1531.279, 'end_time' => 1533.24, 'target_text' => 'Of Jenna.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam syurga Firdaus.', 'order' => 427],
            ['start_time' => 1533.52, 'end_time' => 1537.579, 'target_text' => 'I am hopeful that all of us will have Jenna', 'source_text' => 'Saya penuh harapan bahawa kita semua akan dianugerahkan syurga', 'order' => 428],
            ['start_time' => 1537.679, 'end_time' => 1538.939, 'target_text' => 'By the mercy of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dengan limpah rahmat Allah.', 'order' => 429],
            ['start_time' => 1539.039, 'end_time' => 1545.66, 'target_text' => 'He is the most merciful, the most kind, the most generous, the most forgiving, the most awesome, the most beautiful, the most', 'source_text' => 'Dialah Yang Maha Pemurah, Maha Penyayang, Maha Pengampun, Maha Baik, Maha Menakjubkan, Maha Indah,', 'order' => 430],
